<section class="contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="page-shell contact-layout">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="section-kicker">04 / CONTACT</span>
      <h2 id="contact-title">联系信息，<br />暂未公开<span class="heading-period">。</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-details reveal">
      <p>这个公开版本保留作品与实践内容。联系渠道开放后，会在这里更新。</p>
      <span class="contact-status">请先浏览作品<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <a class="button button-light" href="#work">返回作品 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <button class="button button-light print-button" type="button">打印 / 保存为 PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>document.querySelector(".print-button")?.addEventListener("click", () => window.print());</script>
